cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived tables, please cite the article and this repository."
title: "liver-positional-spectra: positional spectra and cis-coupled gene neighbourhoods in MASLD fibrosis"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline analysing 437 staged human liver biopsies, single-cell RNA-seq,
  11 GTEx tissues, liver eQTLs, GWAS Catalog loci and mouse liver RNA-seq to separate the
  compositional and cell-intrinsic layers of MASLD fibrosis and to characterise cis-coupled
  gene neighbourhoods.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-02"
license: MIT
authors:
